WEBVTT

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:34.700
Riku Suigin, I think you 
already know this, but...

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:35.700
Yeah.

00:01:35.700 --> 00:01:39.920
You mean I'm going to have to defeat everyone 
who's going to try to conquer Stage 0, right?

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:43.560
Looks like we see a common enemy.

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:45.840
Riku Rei's life is on the line, too.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:47.840
We're in the same boat.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.970
I will protect Stage 0 and Riku Rei.

00:01:51.550 --> 00:01:56.560
<b>The Crazy Randengyoku</b>

00:01:59.640 --> 00:02:03.390
The preparations to conquer 
Stage 0 are now complete.

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.730
Carry out the plan.

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:12.130
Dark Tiger-sama, about that plan, 
there's something that concerns me...

00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:17.820
The one who defeated Aslan was a player
more powerful than we'd anticipated.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:21.920
What? There was someone stronger 
than the monkey there?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:25.000
Apparently, he got ahead of us,

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.340
and he wants to settle things with 
the one who stole our quarry first.

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:33.630
You can't be serious! Is he planning 
to ignore our guild's rules?

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.570
This will not do. Order him back immediately—

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.530
Dark Tiger-sama?

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:42.890
Randengyoku's been wanting 
a lone star title.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:43.780
But...

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:47.470
I don't mind letting him do as he pleases.

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:51.720
I'll take you to my boss now.

00:02:51.720 --> 00:02:52.540
Right.

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:53.390
Okay.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.000
What? An explosion among the players?

00:03:01.250 --> 00:03:04.420
Who the heck attacked where 
people are standing?

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:06.110
Don't you have any manners?

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:08.660
Look! Someone's coming out of the smoke!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.950
Talk about reckless.

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:17.950
Who's the one who stole 
my quarry? Show yourself.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:22.930
I'll kill the thief myself.

00:03:23.370 --> 00:03:26.840
He looks like he's another one 
of those guys from earlier.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.880
Riku Suigin, it's time.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:30.880
Let's go.

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:35.230
Oh, I'll let you in on something.

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:35.940
Huh?

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:39.110
Riku Rei is just beyond here.

00:03:39.510 --> 00:03:40.360
All right.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.580
Hey, hurry up and show yourself.

00:03:43.580 --> 00:03:49.840
If you don't, I'm going 
to murder everyone here.

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:52.680
He's one of the upper echelon of Precious!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.600
He must be Randengyoku!

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:56.210
Crap! Everyone, run!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.390
A-A strengthening technique?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.980
That's way to big!

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:21.780
That's messed up!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.250
If he can't find who he's looking for, 
he's going to destroy everything around him!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.210
You need more common sense!

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:30.380
What the heck is common sense?

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:34.330
Whatever I consider fun 
is common sense to me!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.300
He's messed up!

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:40.400
I'm heading to the fortress. 
The transfer gate's been opened.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.460
What are you going to do? 
I'm going to head in.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:48.030
Suigin, forget about that guy 
and let's go save Riku Rei-san!

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.550
Suigin, hurry!

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:57.470
There are so many guys like you 
that are all bark and no bite.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:05:03.860
Now, then... Where's the 
fool who stole my quarry?

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:13.430
Suigin.

00:05:13.430 --> 00:05:14.960
I'm going.

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.890
I believe in you, Suigin.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.840
I'll be waiting for you forever!

00:05:38.900 --> 00:05:41.310
You idiot! What about Riku Rei-san?!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.990
<i>Sorry... Just wait a little 
longer, Riku Rei.</i>

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.660
You idiot. You're like a moth 
to a flame or something.

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:07.960
No one's survived my 
attacks from this range!

00:06:07.960 --> 00:06:09.470
My condolences!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:11.680
No!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:16.720
What?

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.580
Suigin! Are you okay, Suigin?!

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:41.970
Yeah, somewhat...

00:06:41.970 --> 00:06:44.470
I think I survived because 
of the Bloody Armor.

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.670
But that destructive power is insane!

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.380
Isn't he from Totems?

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:54.720
Hey, that's my quarry. Stay out of my way.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.500
Are you listening? Hey!

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:01.640
What's going on? Before, he tried 
to kill us, and now he saved us?

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:05.160
His name is Purple. 
His code name is Kitakaze.

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:07.290
He's one of Totem's eight imperial guards.

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:11.890
As you've already seen, 
 he uses sword skills.

00:07:11.890 --> 00:07:12.750
And...

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:16.440
What are you doing? 
Don't come any closer to Suigin!

00:07:18.220 --> 00:07:19.060
This is...

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.490
Healing.

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:25.090
The damage from those two 
attacks is fading away.

00:07:25.660 --> 00:07:26.890
That's amazing.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:31.050
There aren't many ways to 
heal yourself in this game.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.010
Usually just healing herbs or 
grave beasts with healing skills.

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:40.900
Purple is one of the few players 
that has the title of doctor.

00:07:40.900 --> 00:07:46.300
I heard that there aren't even a hundred 
players in this game that have rare titles.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.660
I just came here to defeat 
the boss of this stage,

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.440
but it looks like I'm super lucky today.

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.040
I'm so excited that I can't stop shaking.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.550
Let's hurry up and do this, my little quarry!

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:05.320
I'm more than enough to deal with you.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:09.090
A weakling from the Totems...

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:13.180
You can't be serious. 
I don't have any time to waste on you.

00:08:13.180 --> 00:08:15.340
Are you done talking?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.140
Wow, so fast...

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.240
Well, this is boring.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:28.210
<i>He's keeping up with me.</i>

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.910
Your dexterity is weak.

00:08:35.620 --> 00:08:37.580
And your strength is basically zero.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.210
Your strikes can't even scratch me.

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:48.180
It went up again.

00:08:48.470 --> 00:08:52.640
For some reason, his attacks seem to 
make my number go up.

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:57.810
I'll look forward to 
something fun happening.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.300
Armed move:

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.780
Tempest Punisher!

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.020
That was a huge shock wave!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:10.530
He has some very destructive attacks.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:12.360
It's taking everything 
I have just to dodge.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.740
Armed move:

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.420
Tempest Arrow!

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:18.880
Crap!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.990
My number didn't go up.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:26.300
Whenever he touches something dealing 
with me, my number goes up.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:29.750
If it gets too high, something 
bad happens, right?

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:33.400
Just like I thought.
 It was just some cheap trick.

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:39.860
But you won't be able to lay a finger 
on me, so I guess I'll never find out.

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:51.820
Beck, why did you show up?

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:56.370
The boss told me and 
Nondead to come save you.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.540
Looks like we made it just in time.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:03.120
Oh? An ice wizard, eh? That's pretty rare.

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.170
Shoukei, break that ice wall.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:14.460
Bro, I don't know what's going on,
 but I can't really move!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.990
I can finally enjoy some quiet teatime.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.230
You guys are way too worked up.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:27.150
Why not calm down and enjoy some tea?

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:29.990
Who are you?

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:32.250
Good grief. You're so violent.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:36.160
Hurry up and untie me.

00:10:36.160 --> 00:10:39.070
Oh? Using a giant tree bind?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.090
That's some fancy summoning magic.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:45.470
Well, you damn monkey, 
are you going to continue?

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:48.420
Well...

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:53.110
Even with Precious's VIP members, 
my skills are vastly superior.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:59.350
My assets total 999,999,999.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.140
I'm the closest to a billion player.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.950
Are you sure about this?

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:10.560
Randengyoku tried to steal your 
status once, Dark Tiger-sama.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.320
Let's have some fun!

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:15.580
Strengthening move: Saiten!

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.350
Honestly... You're ruining my teatime here.

00:11:20.660 --> 00:11:21.720
What is this?

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.310
This is more powerful than Aslan's...

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:29.710
Show me what you're made of,
 sixth billion player!

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:36.220
Show me what you're made of, 
sixth billion player!

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:41.430
<b>Billion Player</b>

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.810
He grew?

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:45.150
The staves on his back are changing!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.140
He can even strengthen his weapons?

00:11:51.100 --> 00:11:52.560
Armored move:

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:55.220
Rikudou Rinne Cannon!

00:11:55.520 --> 00:12:01.700
This baby shoots 666 shots in 
one minute. I'll kill you all.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.700
Everyone, get back!

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:19.680
Such irrational power! At this rate, 
my ice shield won't last long.

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.110
Get away from his range!

00:12:22.110 --> 00:12:24.110
We can't, with all of these blasts!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.320
Suigin!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:28.600
Boring. So boring.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.930
I'm sorry, everyone. I've reached my limit...

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.190
Halo Skill!

00:12:38.500 --> 00:12:40.150
Penta Sanc Wood!

00:12:40.150 --> 00:12:41.110
Activate!

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:49.200
Oh? Are you trying to soften 
the blow with those branches?

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:54.580
Good idea, but I wonder 
how long you'll hold up.

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.120
We're saved?

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:01.960
We might last long enough down 
here until he runs out of bullets.

00:13:01.960 --> 00:13:04.130
No, we can't stay that long.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:06.850
We can buy some time at least.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:10.780
Hey, Billion Player, 
don't you have any ideas?

00:13:11.400 --> 00:13:13.140
I want to ask you something first.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.430
In his case, wouldn't he be 
able to become a Billion Player

00:13:16.430 --> 00:13:18.450
if he defeated another grave beast?

00:13:18.920 --> 00:13:20.730
Why isn't he one yet?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:23.400
What a stupid question at a time like this.

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.000
I'll answer that.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:28.870
It's a pleasure to meet you. My name is Beck.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.160
Thanks. It'll be a huge help.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:36.480
Once a player's assets nears 
a billion, they reach a limit.

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:41.210
No matter how much they strengthen 
their Buster Items or defeat monsters,

00:13:41.210 --> 00:13:43.760
they won't be able to 
receive any more assets.

00:13:44.320 --> 00:13:48.870
There are ten players currently 
nearing that critical point.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:54.010
They are all players that have the potential 
to become Billion Players at any time.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:59.120
Randengyoku, one of the VIP members 
of Precious, is also one of them.

00:14:00.980 --> 00:14:05.780
He reached that critical point in 
the first year of the closed test,

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.330
but he still hasn't become a Billion Player.

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:13.390
In order to get past that critical point, 
you need a lone star grade title.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:16.570
<i>I see... And I...</i>

00:14:17.810 --> 00:14:22.630
<i>obtained a lone star grade title 
when I got my Seabay from Gramps.</i>

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:28.340
Can someone send it to another?

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:33.270
Not really. Your title is 
basically your occupation,

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.810
but the lone star titles 
are filled with mysteries.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:41.690
Warrior | Priest | Archer | Knight | Monk | Samurai

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:40.930
Players gain their titles with their 
experience and their performance.

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:46.040
You can get rare titles by 
completing difficult quests.

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:51.490
In my case, I made over ten thousand healing 
potions and earned the title of doctor.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:56.850
Nondead's title element master
 is one of the ten legendary level.

00:14:57.320 --> 00:15:03.300
He had to master metal, wood, water, fire
and earth magics, which is extremely difficult.

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:07.730
You can look at the titles list 
to find out how to get those titles,

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.850
but it doesn't say how to get a lone star title.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:19.520
That lone star title will finally be mine!

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:26.890
Dark Tiger, it's been a year.

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:31.620
Hurry up and tell me how 
to get a lone star title.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:36.720
I've killed over a hundred high-level 
players, but that didn't work.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:44.850
If I can kill a million player
 with a lone star title, I'll get the title?

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:48.960
Don't do anything stupid. 
You don't stand a chance.

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:52.090
I just want to clear this up already.

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:59.280
Say, boss. If I have the chance to 
challenge one of the Billion Players...

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:01.770
You won't stop me, will you?

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.950
Lone star titles are unique 
and there are only one of each

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:08.410
and have a tremendous corresponding power.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:12.280
Powers that make it possible 
to break the game's rules...

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.320
Powers that can break the rules?

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:18.470
So in the Collector's case, 
she's able to have ten items.

00:16:19.110 --> 00:16:21.950
Then what about the title 
of Grave Guardian?

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:25.300
The enemy's blasts have stopped.

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:26.980
Can someone go check?

00:16:27.260 --> 00:16:28.690
I'll go.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.730
Wait. Don't do anything rash.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.730
Shoukei, just hold on a little longer.

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:37.810
I'll get that off of you.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.030
Boss's Rikudou Rinne Cannon 
needs time to charge.

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:43.470
If we just wait for its 
three minute cool down time...

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:47.160
It'll be able to shoot six times stronger!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:50.490
These three minutes will be their last.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:53.990
<i>Even a Billion Player would be finished...</i>

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:01.870
You don't know what your 
title's special powers are?

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:05.750
I received the title, but I didn't 
get any information about it.

00:17:06.090 --> 00:17:07.840
I do have a plan, though.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:11.510
What do you plan to do? 
We don't know what the enemy will do.

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:13.790
If we can't, that's fine.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:15.970
I'll just have to see with my own eyes.

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:17.610
With your own eyes?

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:20.690
Raven Scarf, activate.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:31.010
<i>Suigin is probably fighting right now. 
I wanted to be by his side, but...</i>

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:34.390
<i>I'm sorry, Suigin. Please don't lose.</i>

00:17:35.940 --> 00:17:37.910
It's been three minutes.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.740
Energy recharge complete.

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:46.920
Now, then... Let's start the final round.

00:17:50.470 --> 00:17:53.440
What can a little girl like you do?

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:56.550
Die along with that crumbling wall!

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.200
It's even stronger than before.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:10.460
Everyone, step back!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.610
And done.

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:18.780
I guess they've all been 
blown to smithereens.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:21.080
Now that I've killed a Billion Player,

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:25.000
I'll finally get a lone star title.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:26.590
Well done, Boss!

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:28.840
He defeated a Billion Player!

00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:32.680
You actually thought you'd won?

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:38.670
None of us have logged out.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:40.150
What?

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:43.990
No wonder I didn't see any system messages.

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:45.690
What happened?

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:49.790
Riku Suigin, I'll admit that 
I didn't see what you did.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:53.500
Could you explain what's going on?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:58.150
The Raven Scarf can only 
choose one jewel at a time.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:03.880
This time, I got the purple jewel that 
allows me to strengthen one part of my body.

00:19:04.340 --> 00:19:05.590
Saturn!

00:19:07.030 --> 00:19:11.550
The statuses of everyone 
here are now visible to me.

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:15.740
Saturn will analyze this information for me.

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:19.610
But you can't save anyone just 
by strengthening your eyes.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:24.010
Saturn must have strengthened some other 
part that has to do with movement.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:29.810
Which means what was strengthened 
is behind you... Your shadow.

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:30.610
That's right.

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:35.520
Saturn uses the light reflected into 
my eyes to gain the knowledge I want.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.600
And makes my shadow explode,

00:19:37.600 --> 00:19:41.930
which gives me the ability to go 
in various directions at once.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.970
Hey, you giant freak, you can't win.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:50.840
You're still not giving up?

00:19:50.840 --> 00:19:53.420
I'd expect nothing less 
from a Billion Player.

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:58.930
I'm one of Precious's VIPs, Randengyoku. 
I won't lose that easily.

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:04.350
All the bullets spread across the 
ground are bombs! Let's all die here!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:07.480
Don't. You've lost.

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:09.770
Stop with your futile struggling.

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:14.330
You idiot. I don't care as long 
as I get to fight to the fullest.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:19.660
If you like fighting so much, I'll give you 
a chance to fight as much as you want.

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:23.900
The chance to challenge my boss, Temujin.

00:20:23.900 --> 00:20:25.250
<i>Temujin?</i>

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:31.780
She just mentioned Temujin and he...

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:35.600
The leader of the Totems and
 one of the six Billion Players...

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:38.310
I still want to keep fighting you,

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:42.020
but if I defeat Temujin, not only 
will I become a Billion Player,

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:45.220
but I'll be able to become the Totem's boss.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.360
This is where Temujin is?

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:07.530
Riku Rei, are you here?

00:21:14.010 --> 00:21:16.750
Let's go... to Temujin.
